    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      507.55,
      538.16,
      550.99
    ],
    "text": "Due to the low level atmospheric disturbance prevailing in the vicinity of Sri Lanka, showery condition is expected to be enhanced over the island from today (20) evening.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      554.8,
      538.32,
      610.06
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa, North-western and Northern provinces and in Anuradhapura district. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in above areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      612.97,
      455.09,
      631.06
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur in other parts of the island after 1.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      634.84,
      537.86,
      673.18
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      681.34,
      537.83,
      791.28
    ],
